# polyglots: glossary term not used: "dashboard" -> "escritorio"; "monitor" -> "supervisar / seguir / vigilar"; "website" -> "sitio web"
# polyglots: "monitoriz" -> "seguimiento / vigilancia / supervisión" (Glossary: monitoring - never "monitorización".)
# polyglots: The glossary term 'Dashboard' must be translated as 'Escritorio' and 'monitor' should be 'supervisar'.
# polyglots: The glossary term 'Dashboard' must be translated as 'Escritorio' and 'monitor' should be 'supervisar'.
#. Found in faq paragraph.
msgid ""
"Yes! WGRank Translate includes a generous Free Plan that allows you to "
"translate up to 10,000 words automatically. You can monitor your live word "
"usage directly from the plugin dashboard. If your website exceeds this "
"limit, you can easily upgrade to a premium plan for unlimited translations "
"and premium SEO features."
msgstr ""
"¡Sí! WGRank Translate incluye un generoso Plan Gratuito que te permite "
"traducir hasta 10.000 palabras automáticamente. Puedes supervisar el uso de "
"palabras en tiempo real directamente desde el Escritorio del plugin. Si tu "
"sitio supera este límite, puedes actualizar fácilmente a un plan premium "
"para obtener traducciones ilimitadas y funciones avanzadas de SEO."

# polyglots: glossary term not used: "deselect" -> "anular selección"
# polyglots: "deseleccion" -> "anular selección" (Glossary: deselect - use "anular selección", never "deseleccionar".)
# polyglots: The glossary term 'deselect' must be translated as 'anular selección' instead of 'deseleccionar'.
#. Found in installation list item.
msgid ""
"<strong>Language Selection:</strong> Use the <strong>Enable/Disable "
"Languages</strong> list to select from 103+ available languages. You can "
"use 'Select All' or 'Deselect All' for quick management."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Selección de idiomas:</strong> Usa la lista "
"<strong>Activar/Desactivar idiomas</strong> para elegir entre más de 103 "
"idiomas disponibles. Puedes usar 'Seleccionar todo' o 'Anular selección' "
"para una gestión rápida."

# polyglots: glossary term not used: "supported" -> "compatible"
# polyglots: The glossary specifies 'compatible' for 'supported'.
#. Found in faq paragraph.
msgid ""
"WGRank Translate supports 103+ languages, allowing you to reach a truly "
"global audience. Our supported languages include:"
msgstr ""
"WGRank Translate admite más de 103 idiomas, lo que te permite llegar a una "
"audiencia verdaderamente global. Nuestros idiomas compatibles incluyen:"

# polyglots: glossary term not used: "firewall" -> "cortafuegos"
# polyglots: The glossary term 'firewall' must be translated as 'cortafuegos'.
#. Found in description list item.
msgid ""
"<strong>Cloudflare Bypass Optimized:</strong> Smart Web Application "
"Firewall (WAF) integration ensuring secure JSON execution under strict "
"firewalls."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Optimizado para bypass de Cloudflare:</strong> Integración "
"inteligente con el cortafuegos de aplicaciones web (WAF) que garantiza una "
"ejecución segura de JSON bajo cortafuegos estrictos."

# polyglots: glossary term not used: "post" -> "entrada"
# polyglots: The glossary term 'post' refers to 'entrada', but here 'post' is a preposition meaning 'after', so the current translation is correct. However, since it's flagged as not using the glossary term, I'm clearing it as a false positive by the automated check.
# polyglots: the proposed fix was unchanged from what was submitted
#. Found in description list item.
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<strong>Secure Checkout:</strong> The cart, payment flow, and user sessions "
"remain fully functional post-translation."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Checkout seguro:</strong> El carrito, el flujo de pago y las "
"sesiones de usuario permanecen completamente funcionales después de la "
"traducción."

# polyglots: glossary term not used: "core" -> "núcleo"; "website" -> "sitio web"
# polyglots: The term 'website' should be translated as 'sitio web' according to the glossary.
#. Found in description list item.
msgid ""
"<strong>Zero PHP Processing:</strong> Cached pages serve without loading "
"heavy PHP. Helps improve Core Web Vitals and website performance."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Cero procesamiento PHP:</strong> Las páginas en caché se sirven sin "
"cargar ejecuciones pesadas de PHP. Ayuda a mejorar Core Web Vitals y el "
"rendimiento del sitio web."

# polyglots: glossary term not used: "header" -> "cabecera"; "language" -> "idioma"
# polyglots: The terms 'header' and 'language' should be translated as 'cabecera' and 'idioma' according to the glossary.
#. Found in description list item.
msgid ""
"<strong>Full DOM Interception:</strong> Captures everything from header to "
"footer, ensuring a consistent WordPress language plugin experience."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Interceptación completa del DOM:</strong> Captura todo, desde la "
"cabecera hasta el pie de página, garantizando una experiencia coherente de "
"plugin de idioma para WordPress."

# polyglots: The term 'website' should be translated as 'sitio web' according to the glossary.
# polyglots: the proposed fix was unchanged from what was submitted
#. Found in description list item.
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<strong>Server-side Translation:</strong> Instant website localization as "
"users browse, with no waiting."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Traducción del lado del servidor:</strong> Localización instantánea "
"del sitio web a medida que los usuarios navegan, sin esperas."

# polyglots: The term 'site' should be translated as 'sitio' according to the glossary.
# polyglots: the proposed fix was unchanged from what was submitted
#. Found in description list item.
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<strong>AI-Powered:</strong> As a modern AI translation plugin, it "
"translates your WordPress site into 103+ languages using advanced Neural AI "
"Machine Translation via WGRank Cloud TDN."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Potenciado por IA:</strong> Como un moderno plugin de traducción "
"por IA, traduce tu sitio de WordPress a más de 103 idiomas mediante "
"traducción automática neuronal avanzada a través de WGRank Cloud TDN."

# polyglots: glossary term not used: "core" -> "núcleo"; "website" -> "sitio web"
# polyglots: The glossary terms 'core' and 'website' were not used in the translation.
#. Found in description header.
msgid "AI Website Translation &amp; Core Technology"
msgstr "Traducción de sitios web con IA y tecnología núcleo"

# polyglots: 'Configuración de ajustes' is a redundant calque of 'Settings configuration'.
# polyglots: the model's fix was kept, but brought in what the submitted text did not have: glossary ("settings" -> "ajustes")
#. Screenshot description.
msgid ""
"Settings configuration for SEO tags (hreflang, canonical) and switcher "
"customization."
msgstr ""
"Configuración de etiquetas SEO (hreflang, canónica) y personalización del "
"selector."

# polyglots: glossary term not used: "sitemap" -> "mapa del sitio"
# polyglots: The glossary term 'sitemap' must be translated as 'mapa del sitio'.
#. Screenshot description.
msgid ""
"Sitemap management screen displaying automatically generated "
"language-specific XML sitemaps."
msgstr ""
"Pantalla de gestión de mapas del sitio que muestra los mapas del sitio XML "
"específicos por idioma generados automáticamente."

# polyglots: glossary term not used: "default" -> "por defecto"
# polyglots: The glossary term 'default' must be translated as 'por defecto'.
#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid ""
"Fix: Resolved language switcher base language link overwrite on translated "
"pages (e.g., /ar/), ensuring default language (English) consistently points "
"to clean origin URL with correct hreflang."
msgstr ""
"Corrección: Se resolvió la sobrescritura del enlace del idioma base del "
"selector de idioma en las páginas traducidas (por ejemplo, /ar/), "
"garantizando que el idioma por defecto (inglés) apunte siempre a la URL de "
"origen limpia con el hreflang correcto."

# polyglots: glossary term not used: "default" -> "por defecto"
# polyglots: The glossary term 'default' must be translated as 'por defecto'.
#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid ""
"Fix: Resolved single-slash protocol corruption (https:/ and http:/) in "
"canonical and og:url meta tags on default/non-translated pages."
msgstr ""
"Corrección: Se resolvió la corrupción del protocolo de una sola barra "
"(https:/ y http:/) en las etiquetas meta canonical y og:url de las páginas "
"por defecto/no traducidas."

# polyglots: glossary term not used: "firewall" -> "cortafuegos"
# polyglots: The glossary term 'firewall' must be translated as 'cortafuegos'.
#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid ""
"Fix: Whitelisted all search engine crawlers (Googlebot, "
"Google-InspectionTool, Bingbot, Yandex, Applebot) and CLI tools (cURL, "
"WP-CLI, warmup scripts) from bot firewall, preventing false-positive 429 "
"Too Many Requests on uncached translation pages."
msgstr ""
"Corrección: Se incluyeron en la lista blanca todos los rastreadores de "
"motores de búsqueda (Googlebot, Google-InspectionTool, Bingbot, Yandex, "
"Applebot) y las herramientas CLI (cURL, WP-CLI, scripts de "
"precalentamiento) del cortafuegos de bots, evitando falsos positivos de 429 "
"Too Many Requests en páginas de traducción sin caché."

# polyglots: glossary term not used: "feature" -> "característica" / "destacar"; "locale" -> "configuración regional"; "site" -> "sitio"
# polyglots: The glossary term 'feature' should be 'característica' and 'site' should be 'sitio'.
#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid ""
"Feature: Added automatic Open Graph (og:locale, og:url, og:site_name) and "
"Twitter card meta tags for translated pages when third-party SEO plugins "
"are absent."
msgstr ""
"Característica: Se añadieron automáticamente las etiquetas meta de Open "
"Graph (og:locale, og:url, og:site_name) y las etiquetas meta de tarjetas de "
"Twitter para las páginas traducidas cuando no hay plugins SEO de terceros."

# polyglots: glossary term not used: "support" -> "es compatible con / dar soporte"
# polyglots: Use the glossary term 'administración' instead of 'backend' for the admin area.
#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid ""
"Enhancement: Expanded language support to 104 native languages, including "
"comprehensive localization for backend admin menus and strings."
msgstr ""
"Mejora: Soporte de idiomas ampliado a 104 idiomas nativos, incluyendo "
"localización completa para menús de administración y cadenas de la "
"administración."

# polyglots: glossary term not used: "support" -> "es compatible con / dar soporte"
# polyglots: Use the glossary term 'dar soporte' for 'support'.
# polyglots: the proposed fix was unchanged from what was submitted
#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Enhancement: Restored server-side translation support for logged-in users, "
"providing a consistent multilingual experience across the board."
msgstr ""
"Mejora: Se restauró el soporte de traducción del lado del servidor para "
"usuarios conectados, ofreciendo una experiencia multilingüe coherente en "
"todo momento."

# polyglots: glossary term not used: "support" -> "es compatible con / dar soporte"
# polyglots: Use the glossary term 'dar soporte' for 'support'.
# polyglots: the proposed fix was unchanged from what was submitted
#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Feature: Added HTML Classes, Tags, and IDs translation exclusion support "
"for precise content control."
msgstr ""
"Característica: Se añadió soporte de exclusión de traducción para clases "
"HTML, etiquetas e IDs para un control preciso del contenido."

# polyglots: glossary term not used: "tweak" -> "retoque"
# polyglots: The term 'tweak' should be 'retoque' and the UI element should use the glossary term 'administración'.
# polyglots: The term 'tweak' should be 'retoque' and the UI element should use the glossary term 'administración'.
#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid ""
"Tweak: Renamed \"Cache\" tab to \"Translations\" in the WP Admin UI for "
"better clarity."
msgstr ""
"Retoque: Se renombró la pestaña \"Cache\" a \"Traducciones\" en la interfaz "
"de administración de WP para mayor claridad."

# polyglots: glossary term not used: "notification" -> "aviso"
# polyglots: "notific" -> "aviso / avisar" (Glossary: notification/notify - use "aviso/avisar", never "notificación/notificar".)
# polyglots: The glossary explicitly forbids 'notificación' and requires 'aviso'.
#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid ""
"Feature: Added Word Limit Tracking and visually enhanced Notification in "
"the Dashboard for Free Tier users."
msgstr ""
"Característica: Se añadió seguimiento del límite de palabras y un aviso "
"visualmente mejorado en el Escritorio para usuarios del plan gratuito."

# polyglots: glossary term not used: "fixed" -> "corregido"; "permalink" -> "enlace permanente"; "post" -> "entrada"; "post types" -> "tipos de contenido"
# polyglots: The glossary requires 'tipos de contenido' instead of 'tipos de publicación' for 'post types'.
#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid ""
"Major Bugfix: Fixed a critical routing issue where custom post types and "
"custom permalink structures on translated inner pages would incorrectly "
"fall back to loading the homepage."
msgstr ""
"Corrección importante: Se corrigió un problema crítico de enrutamiento en "
"el que los tipos de contenido personalizados y las estructuras de enlaces "
"permanentes personalizados en páginas internas traducidas cargaban "
"incorrectamente la página de inicio."

# polyglots: glossary term not used: "fixed" -> "corregido"; "login" -> "acceder / acceso"
# polyglots: "inicio de sesión" -> "acceso" (Glossary: login - use "Acceder"/"acceso", never "inicio de sesión".)
# polyglots: The glossary specifies that 'login' should be 'acceder' or 'acceso', not 'inicio de sesión'.
#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid ""
"Fixed an issue where the WordPress login, registration, and logout pages "
"could trigger cookie blocking errors on translated URLs."
msgstr ""
"Se corrigió un problema donde las páginas de acceso, registro y cierre de "
"sesión de WordPress podían generar errores de bloqueo de cookies en URLs "
"traducidas."

# polyglots: The glossary requires 'ajustes' for 'Settings'; the English term should not be included in the text.
#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid ""
"UX Improvement: Added a direct 'Settings' action link on the WordPress "
"Plugins page for faster navigation."
msgstr ""
"Mejora de UX: Se añadió un enlace de acción directo a Ajustes en la página "
"de plugins de WordPress para una navegación más rápida."

# polyglots: glossary term not used: "sitemap" -> "mapa del sitio"
# polyglots: The glossary term 'sitemap' must be translated as 'mapa del sitio'.
#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Added native localized SEO sitemap indexing."
msgstr "Se añadió indexación nativa de mapa del sitio de SEO localizado."

# polyglots: 'Parcheado' is a literal calque of 'patched'; 'Corregido' or 'Se corrigió' is more natural in Spanish for a changelog.
#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Patched caching mechanism for Strict Cloudflare WAF configurations."
msgstr ""
"Se corrigió el mecanismo de almacenamiento en caché para configuraciones "
"estrictas de WAF de Cloudflare."
